Regression Explorer

Regression Explorer is an interactive statistical analysis application developed using Python and Streamlit.
The app allows users to upload CSV datasets, explore variables, create graphs, and perform regression analysis. 
It includes linear and polynomial regression, residual plots, hypothesis testing, nested F-tests, and 10-fold cross-validation.
The application was developed as part of a data analytics course to combine the statistical methods learned throughout the semester into one platform.
To use the app, upload a CSV file, select the response and predictor variables, and choose the type of analysis you want to perform.
